  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rhino &amp; Tiger Conservation Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project provides funds necessary for the operating expenses of the IUCNs African Rhino Specialists Group which provides technical support for all African rhino range states and objective advice to non-range states. This funding will support the operating budget for the period July 2014-June 2015, including expenses of the scientific officer, travel and operating costs of the Chair, Vice Chair and scientific officer in order to provide objective, reliable and timely scientific information to the international community on African rhinos and to provide technical support for the development and long-term maintenance of viable populations of all subspecies of African black and white rhinos.</narrative>
  </description>
